        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='32254' id='219' type-v2='text' w='36571' x='31012' y='8259'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Afghanistan is responsible for the most refugees of any country ever</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Afghanistan has been plagued by wars ever since UN has collected data</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- In 1990, while the population was around 10 million, there were over 6 million Afghan refugees (60% of the population). </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Pakistan and Iran (both neighboring countries) have provided asylum to the majority of Afghan refugees for several years</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
