          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='82014' hidden='true' id='7' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='54886' x='995' y='17647'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000'>Summary</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>This project analyzes UN Refugee data between 1951 and 2023. It tells a story about where refugees come from and where they find refuge around the world. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000'>Motivation</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>After living in El Salvador for a year after college, I saw first hand how the fear of violence displaces families and communities. While the decision to emigrate is often based on a myriad of reasons not related to violence, I have been curious ever since why people leave their country of origin and where they choose to go. This project can’t answer all those questions, but the goal is to understand when and where people go when they feel threatened, and which countries welcome them in.</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>Æ </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000'>Additionally, as the birthrate of natives in the US continues to fall further and further below the repopulation rate, it has been posited that immigration might be our best solution to the ever increasing demographic dilemma. I want to know where the trends are heading, and how I can help advocate. </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000'>Questions:</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>- Where are refugees coming from and where are they going?</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>- Which countries/continents welcome the most refugees?</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>- How does war affect the number of refugees? </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>- Do people typically flee to countries nearby or far away? </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#010101'>- Do neighboring countries open their boarders during times of war?</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='81954' hidden='true' id='21' story-point-id='12' type-v2='text' w='98848' x='970' y='17701'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Methodology</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>
- Refugee was downloaded from the UN Refugee Agency website, and covers 213 countries between 1951 - 2023
- Population data was downloaded from the World Bank
- All data was imported into Jupyter Notebooks where it was cleaned and analyzed. 
- Once cleaned, the data was uploaded into Tableau to create interactive dashboards


</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0'>Limitations</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>
- The UN&apos;s collection of refugee data has improved over time, so earlier years do not encompass the full scope of refugees as well as later years
- The UN did not start tracking &apos;country of origin&apos; for many countries until 1970&apos;s
- Data only includes persons who went through the UN refugee application process.

</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' forceUpdate='true' h='81900' hidden='true' id='22' story-point-id='7' type-v2='text' w='43359' x='56290' y='17647'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='0' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='20'>Outline</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>- Country of Origin</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>    - Overview</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>    - Focus countries</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>- Countries of Asylum</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>    - Overview</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>    - Focus countries </run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='0' fontsize='20'>- Correlations between countries of origin vs asylum</run>
            <run fontalignment='0'>Æ&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
        <zone flipboard-zone-id='5' h='81787' id='23' story-point-id='27' type-v2='text' w='99064' x='410' y='17647'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run>Want to get involved?&#10;</run>
            <run auto-url='true' hyperlink='tabdoc:load-url url=&amp;quot;https://www.unhcr.org/get-involved&amp;quot;'>https://www.unhcr.org/get-involved</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <simple-id uuid='{8A331982-0573-4A3B-960F-1CB4C374280B}' />
    </dashboard>
