          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Whereas most countries tend to </run>
            <run fontcolor='#202122' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>fluctuate</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>, the US has remained steady, </run>
            <run fontcolor='#202122' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>accepting</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'> around 400-500k refugees per year</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Pakistan and Iran acceptepted refugees from Afghanistan</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Turkey opened their boarder in 2011 for Syrian refugees during their Civil War</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
