        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='36199' id='217' type-v2='text' w='39555' x='37507' y='23643'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- The largest number of refugees from El Salvador coincide with the dates of the Civil War of 1979-1992</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Even after the war ended, it took several years before the number of refugees returned to a baseline</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Most refugees fled to neighboring countries during the war</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Most refugees fled to the US when not in a war</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Further Analysis: What is responsible for the rise of refugees in recent years? Gang violence? Political unrest? </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='12500' id='218' type-v2='text' w='21592' x='8133' y='7254'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='16'>Salvadoran Civil War </run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='16'>(1979 - 1992)</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
