        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='8145' id='9' type-v2='text' w='18841' x='64950' y='82127'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1a1a1a' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='14'>Syrian Civil War</run>
            <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#1a1a1a' fontname='-apple-system' fontsize='11'>(February 2011 - present)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='53620' id='197' type-v2='text' w='33353' x='7490' y='8710'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- The sharp increase in refugees coincides with the Syrian Civil War that began in 2011.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Turkey has received the majority of Syrian refugees, over 2 million per year between 2015 and 2023. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Other countries of asylum are neighboring countries with the exception of Germany. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Population had been increasing steadily for years, but dips sharply at the beginning of the war, likely from the rise of refugees seeking asylum. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Further Analysis: What will these numbers look like as the war continues? After the war, how long before refugee numbers return to a baseline? </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
