        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='17647' id='9' type-v2='text' w='7030' x='78500' y='69005'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#1a1a1a' fontname='Benton Sans Book' fontsize='12'>Russia-Ukraine War</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#1a1a1a' fontname='-apple-system' fontsize='10'>(February 2022 - present)</run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='solid' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='45759' id='226' type-v2='text' w='36805' x='10240' y='27902'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#202122' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- The sharp increase of refugees fleeing from Ukraine in 2022 coincides with the beginning of the Russia-Ukraine War. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#202122' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Population has been decreasing steadily prior to the war, but then takes a sharp downward turn in 2022. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#202122' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Ukrainians mostly find refuge in neighboring countries to the West. </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#202122' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- The full-scale invasion of Ukraine began in 2022, but Russia started occupying Ukraine in 2014, which coincides with the hump seen in ~2014-2016.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Arial' fontsize='14'>- Further Analysis: What will these numbers look like as the war continues? After the war, how long before refugee numbers return to a baseline? </run>
          </formatted-text>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='dotted' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='2' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
